{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125054638277-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125063316\"/><p>警員圍封現場調查。(梁國雄攝)</p><p>今日(25日)清晨5時23分，執法部門接獲報案，指一名中年男子倒臥在北角長康街香港教育大學北角教學中心對開馬路。救援人員到場將已陷入昏迷的事主送往律敦治醫院救治，馬路遺下一攤血漬。據了解，警員不排除事主從高處墮下或遇車禍，正就事件展開調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T22:44:23.879647+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T21:46:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T22:37:51.303534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T22:37:51.303534+00:00","content_hash":"552ae391e7096374931c7856a436364004b8750685de2a25c76dec9d25cf78bc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}